From 0548b1663d57cad506c1ccef8243f8fed5fe098f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DataViewer-Desktop Sync <sync@dataviewer-desktop.local>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 19:00:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): multi-root drive browsing backend (D16)

File Explorer roots: on Windows enumerate every mounted drive (C:\, D:\ ...
incl. removable) alongside the app data root; POSIX keeps {data, home}.
- safe_path rewritten cross-platform (pathlib drive-letter/separator aware);
  preserves the legacy root-relative semantics for other absolute paths.
- root-relative paths returned by the File Explorer are normalized to forward
  slashes via .as_posix() so the frontend sees one separator convention.
- /api/system/disk-space reports the current runtime root, not static DATA_ROOT.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
